    Bug 2001602 - remove extractEventLocaleList/extractTaskLocaleList and related code. r=tobyp


    This is something from back when calendar was lightning... The toolbarbutton menupopup is never shown,
    it has not text, and the code would not work anyway due to extractWithLocale() passing null to extractFromEmail().

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D273619

